{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Do not profile your daughter to make her whore.</b> This is one who keeps his grown daughter unmarried." "<b>And the land shall not whore.</b> If you whore, the land shall whore. How so? He hoped to make grapes and it made foul berries; you sow wheat and it produces thorns for you. Another interpretation: ולא תזנה הארץ — and the inhabitants of the land shall not whore; an analogy: ״ארץ כי תחטא לי״." "<b>Lewdness.</b> What is it?"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:38.971061920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}